    <code code="42348-3" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="Advance directives"/>
    <title>Advance Care Planning</title>
    <text><paragraph>Voluntary advance care planning discussion of about 15 minutes, with her consent, after her recent surgery. She wants full treatment for any illness, wants to make her own decisions, and wants information about her health shared only with the people she names. She named a health care agent, recorded in the confidential part of the chart and not named here. She chose not to record other treatment preferences today. To be revisited yearly or if her health changes. [S]</paragraph></text>

